---
// Mint — YSWS landing page
const title = "Mint — an Altoids-tin hardware YSWS";
const description = "Ship a hardware project sized to an Altoids tin, journal the build, and get a $75 grant plus the tin itself.";
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="topbar">
    <a href="#" class="logo"><span class="dot"></span>MINT</a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#deal">The deal</a>
      <a href="#fits">What fits</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#submit" class="cta-small">Submit</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">
  <section class="hero" style="border-top:none;">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">A Hack Club YSWS · you ship, we ship</p>
      <h1>Build something that fits<br>in an <span class="accent">Altoids tin.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Mint is a hardware challenge for small spaces. Ship a project sized to a real Altoids tin, journal how you built it, and we'll send you the tin itself plus a $75 grant to fill it.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#submit" class="btn btn-primary">Start your project →</a>
        <a href="https://slack.com/archives/C0BK69GFA0Z" class="btn btn-ghost">Join #mint on Slack</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tin-stage">
      <div>
        <div class="tin-photo-frame">
          <img src="/mintysws/altoids-tin.png" alt="An Altoids tin" />
        </div>
        <p class="spec-tag">Fits within <span>3.75" × 2.375" × 0.8"</span><br>the footprint of a real Altoids tin</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="deal">
    <p class="section-kicker">The exchange</p>
    <h2>You ship, we ship.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Straightforward trade: you build and document something that lives inside an Altoids tin, we cover the cost of making it happen.</p>
    <div class="deal-grid">
      <div class="deal-card">
        <h3>You provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>A hardware project that fits inside an Altoids tin</li>
          <li>A GitHub journal of the design process</li>
          <li>No timelapses needed — just real progress logs</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="swap-icon">⇄</div>
      <div class="deal-card">
        <h3>We provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>An Altoids tin to build inside</li>
          <li>A $75 grant on completion</li>
          <li>A spot in the #mint community</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="fits">
    <p class="section-kicker">Scope</p>
    <h2>If it's contained in the Altoids tin, it counts.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Beginner or advanced, simple or clever — here's the kind of thing past builders have shipped in similar formats. Use these as a starting point, not a limit.</p>
    <div class="fits-grid">
      <div class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="9" width="18" height="8" rx="1.5"/><path d="M6 9V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2M6 17v3M18 17v3"/><circle cx="9" cy="13" r="1.5"/><circle cx="13.5" cy="13" r="1.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="13" r="1.5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Micro synth</h4>
        <p>A pocket-sized noisemaker — oscillators, buttons, maybe a speaker crammed into the lid.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><rect x="7" y="6" width="10" height="7" rx="1"/><circle cx="9" cy="17" r="1.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1.2"/><circle cx="15" cy="17" r="1.2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Pocket game</h4>
        <p>A tiny screen and a couple of buttons is all it takes for a game you can carry anywhere.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M7 10v4M11 10v4M15 10h3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Hacking tool</h4>
        <p>Flipper Zero-esque gadget for signal sniffing, badge cloning, or general mischief.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.9 4.9l2.8 2.8M16.3 16.3l2.8 2.8M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.9 19.1l2.8-2.8M16.3 7.7l2.8-2.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Meshtastic node</h4>
        <p>A tin-sized off-grid radio node, because mesh networks deserve tiny enclosures too.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="how">
    <p class="section-kicker">Process</p>
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">01</span>
        <h4>Get the spec</h4>
        <p>Your build envelope is fixed: 3.75" × 2.375" × 0.8". Everything else is up to you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">02</span>
        <h4>Design + build</h4>
        <p>Sketch it, prototype it, solder it. Short and scrappy beats big and stalled.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">03</span>
        <h4>Journal on GitHub</h4>
        <p>Log your process the way Rework, Highway, and Outpost builders do. No timelapses required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">04</span>
        <h4>Ship it</h4>
        <p>Submit when it's done. We send the $75 grant and your Altoids tin.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section>
    <div class="why">
      <blockquote>Mint is a "fresh" challenge in hardware — a short break from the big projects everyone's been slaving away on.</blockquote>
      <div class="why-copy">
        <p>Most people building lately have gravitated toward big, extravagant projects. Those can wear on you mentally.</p>
        <p>Mint is a lower-stakes, lower-hour-count alternative — something a beginner or an advanced builder can pick up, finish, and actually feel good about shipping.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="submit">
    <p class="section-kicker">Ready?</p>
    <h2>Submit your project</h2>
    <div class="submit-panel">
      <p>Fill out the form below once your project is built and journaled. Have questions first? Drop them in <a href="https://slack.com/archives/C0BK69GFA0Z" style="color:var(--mint);">#mint</a>.</p>
      <div class="form-embed">
        <iframe
          src="https://form.fillout.com/t/your-fillout-form-id"
          title="Mint submission form"
          loading="lazy"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="form-note">↑ replace the Fillout form URL with your live form before publishing</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    Mint · a Hack Club YSWS · <a href="https://slack.com/archives/C0BK69GFA0Z">#mint on Slack</a>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>

<style>

  :root {
    --bg: #efe8dc;
    --bg-alt: #f7f2e8;
    --paper: #fffdf9;
    --paper-strong: #f1eadb;
    --ink: #171612;
    --ink-soft: #4a433b;
    --muted: #746c63;
    --line: rgba(23, 22, 18, 0.12);
    --accent: #213a2d;
    --accent-soft: #d7ddd3;
    --red: #b84b2b;
    --red-soft: #f0d6cb;
    --display: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    --body: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255,255,255,0.7), transparent 30%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #f6f1e9 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--body);
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    * { animation-duration: 0.001ms !important; transition-duration: 0.001ms !important; }
  }

  a { color: inherit; }
  .wrap { max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(239, 232, 220, 0.82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 18px 24px;
  }

  .logo {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .logo .dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--red);
    display: inline-block;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(184, 75, 43, 0.08);
  }

  .topbar nav a {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-left: 24px;
  }

  .topbar nav a:hover { color: var(--red); }
  .topbar .cta-small {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 88px 0 56px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.08fr 0.92fr;
    gap: 52px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 56px; }
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--red);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 82px);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  h1 .accent {
    color: var(--red);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.35rem);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 42ch;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  .btn {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 16px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 30px rgba(23, 22, 18, 0.12);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .tin-stage { display: flex; justify-content: center; }

  .tin-photo-frame {
    position: relative;
    width: min(100%, 360px);
    padding: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.34);
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
    box-shadow: 18px 18px 0 rgba(33, 58, 45, 0.06);
  }

  .tin-photo-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    background: var(--paper-strong);
  }

  .spec-tag {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .spec-tag span { color: var(--red); }

  section {
    padding: 66px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 54px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .section-kicker {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .section-intro {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0 0 34px;
    font-size: 1.03rem;
  }

  .deal-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 26px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  @media (max-width:720px) {
    .deal-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .deal-grid .swap-icon { display: none; }
  }

  .deal-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.52);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 26px 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(23,22,18,0.02);
  }

  .deal-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--red);
  }

  .deal-card ul { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .deal-card li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 9px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .deal-card li:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .deal-card li::before { content: "—"; color: var(--red); }

  .swap-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    color: var(--red);
    font-size: 28px;
  }

  .fits-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .fit-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.38);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 22px 20px;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .fit-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: rgba(184, 75, 43, 0.35);
  }

  .fit-card .icon {
    color: var(--red);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .fit-card h4 {
    font-family: var(--body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .fit-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.97rem; }

  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  @media (max-width:860px) { .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width:520px) { .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .step {
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 2px solid rgba(184, 75, 43, 0.28);
  }

  .step .num {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--red);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .step h4 { font-family: var(--body); font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .step p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .why {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width:760px) { .why { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .why blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--red);
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .why .why-copy p { margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .submit-panel {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 30px 22px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .submit-panel p { color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 52ch; margin: 0 auto 24px; }

  .form-embed {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 420px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .form-embed iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 520px;
    border: none;
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .form-note {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  footer {
    padding: 36px 0 52px;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  footer a { color: var(--red); text-decoration: none; }
  footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
